OL,3,GNEWSAWoman who 'groomed' and sexually
OL,4,Aabused boy jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who "groomed" and repeatedly
OL,7,Fsexually abused a teenage boy has been
OL,8,Fjailed for more than nine years.
OL,10,FTracy Bancroft abused the boy when she
OL,11,Fwas aged in her late 40s or early 50s
OL,12,Fafter giving him alcohol and
OL,13,Fcigarettes, York Crown Court heard.
OL,15,FBancroft, 64, who initially disputing
OL,16,Fhis age at the time, admitted three
OL,17,Fcounts of sexual activity with a child.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
