OL,3,GNEWSAWoman who 'groomed' and sexually
OL,4,Aabused boy jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt the court on Tuesday, Bancroft, from
OL,7,FFiley, North Yorkshire, was placed on
OL,8,Fthe sex-offenders' register for life
OL,9,Fand was sentenced to nine years and
OL,10,Ffour months in prison.
